config BR2_PACKAGE_STREAM_BENCHMARK
	bool "STREAM 5.10 memory bandwidth benchmark"
	depends on BR2_USE_MMU
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_OPENMP
	help
	  The author's unmodified STREAM 5.10 C benchmark with OpenMP
	  workers. Set OMP_NUM_THREADS to control the worker count.

	  Results may be called STREAM results only when the author's run rules
	  are followed. PipOS does not automatically publish or compare them.

	  https://www.cs.virginia.edu/stream/
